  "post_title": "76 fotos dels concerts de Nadal de la Societat Artístico Musical Vila d'Onda (SAMVO)",
  "post_date": "2018-01-07 21:32:41",
  "post_name": "76-fotos-dels-concerts-de-nadal-de-la-societat-artistico-musical-vila-donda-samvo",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/OrquestraSAMVOvicenteSegui.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El 23 de desembre l&#39;orquestra acompanyava Vicente Segu&iacute; en l&#39;espectacle &#39;Navidad Sinf&oacute;nica&#39;, mentre que el 30 de desembre es presentava la nova banda de la SAMVO, dirigida per Sergio Calpe G&oacute;mez, i el muntatge Nit a l&ograve;pera.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/OperaBandaSAMVO.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Les dos actuacions han sigut al Teatre M&ograve;naco i Maria Velasco (soprano), Kristina Dovidaitis (mezzosporano) i Jes&uacute;s &Aacute;lvarez (tenor) han intervingut en la segona.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsinfonicsamvo17/img_4167.jpg\" alt=\"img_4167\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsinfonicsamvo17/img_4169.jpg\" alt=\"img_4169\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsinfonicsamvo17/img_4172.jpg\" alt=\"img_4172\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsinfonicsamvo17/img_4174.jpg\" alt=\"img_4174\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsinfonicsamvo17/img_4176.jpg\" alt=\"img_4176\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsinfonicsamvo17/img_4178.jpg\" alt=\"img_4178\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsinfonicsamvo17/img_4184.jpg\" alt=\"img_4184\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src